WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.539
Welcome.

00:00.539 --> 00:09.032
In Japan, in the Edo period, pictures printed by the thousand show the pleasures of the city, actors, beauties and landscapes.

00:09.032 --> 00:12.806
They are called ukiyo-e: pictures of the floating world.

00:12.806 --> 00:18.400
Move the prints, enlarge them with two fingers, turn them over to read their story.
